{#
  TLS guard: strings for tls-ui.js / certificates.js / the zones + settings
  scripts, exposed as JSON island #tls-i18n and merged into GC.t by tls-ui.js
  (docs/feature-tls-guard.md, "Sprachschlüssel"). Shared by all three themes;
  include it inside the content block of certificates.njk, zones.njk and
  settings.njk. tests/tls_ui_static.test.js checks the key list; the caa.*
  and alias.of strings serve the CAA recommendation and the alias rows of the
  certificates page (docs/feature-security-options.md §A/§G).
#}
